[Music]  the european union is serious about our  commitment to fight the climate crisis  by 2030 we aim to cut greenhouse gas  emissions by at least 55 percent this is  a key component of the european green  deal  to reach climate neutrality by 2050  restore biodiversity and advance towards  zero pollution for water air and soil we  need to take action in every sector of  the economy  a climate neutral future can bring  prosperity and a safe and healthy  environment for everyone  by applying the latest science we can  develop the necessary innovative ideas  in time  in the sevilla process the eu is working  together with industry and ngos to  reduce pollution from over 52 000 large  industrial plants in europe  the sevilla process helps to take  decisions based on consensus and  transparency underpinned by solid  scientific and technical data  [Music]  commission through its joint research  center has years of experience  identifying the right technologies for  sustainable progress we connect  scientists ngos and industry with  european and national authorities to  reduce pollution and guarantee a  globally competitive industry this is  our way the european way  the civilian process is a genuine  european achievement it is a tested  reliable mechanism it uses science to  forge agreements for a healthier  environment and more competitive  industry  let's use this experience to drive the  green transition forward  we must now apply our best ideas and get  ready for a green and healthy future  [Music]

